					"id": 4461878677,
					"author": "joeblackwaslike",
					"createdAt": "2026-11-03T23:54:18Z",
					"editedAt": null,
					"body": "FetchResult's solve fields are now a union, so `solveReason` exists only when `solve` is \"failed\", and app.ts narrows on `result.solve === \"failed\"` before reading it (cd7ec576). `tagSolveReason` now returns `SolveReasonError` (6ec8332d)."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"threadId": "PRRT_kwDOVL2EQc6zYDcJ",
			"commentId": 4461659356,
			"isResolved": true,
			"isOutdated": true,
			"resolvedBy": "joeblackwaslike",
			"replies": [
				{
					"id": 4461879455,
					"author": "joeblackwaslike",
					"createdAt": "2026-11-03T23:54:24Z",
					"editedAt": null,
					"body": "A failed fetch now keeps its class, message and cause code (e.g. `TypeError: fetch failed (ENOTFOUND)`), which appears in the submit error and as the last failure in the timeout error (17d39dc1). The redacted message reaches the `solve_failed` log as `err` via 343ac0ea."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"threadId": "PRRT_kwDOVL2EQc6zYDcN",
			"commentId": 4461659361,
			"isResolved": true,
			"isOutdated": true,
			"resolvedBy": "joeblackwaslike",
			"replies": [
				{
					"id": 4461880207,
					"author": "joeblackwaslike",
					"createdAt": "2026-11-03T23:54:29Z",
					"editedAt": null,
					"body": "A 423 whose body isn't JSON now reports reason `unparseable`; a JSON body without a reason still reports `unknown`, and the test was updated (c4b6f891)."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"threadId": "PRRT_kwDOVL2EQc6zYDcQ",
			"commentId": 4461659365,
			"isResolved": true,
			"isOutdated": false,
			"resolvedBy": "joeblackwaslike",
			"replies": [
				{
					"id": 4461881046,
					"author": "joeblackwaslike",
					"createdAt": "2026-11-03T23:54:34Z",
					"editedAt": null,
					"body": "A failed solve now carries `solveError`, the error's class and message with the ws endpoint redacted, and app.ts logs it as `err` next to the fixed `reason` in `solve_failed` (343ac0ea). The reason vocabulary is unchanged."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"threadId": "PRRT_kwDOVL2EQc6zYDcS",
