			"replies": [
				{
					"id": 4461882892,
					"author": "joeblackwaslike",
					"createdAt": "2026-11-03T23:54:45Z",
					"editedAt": null,
					"body": "test/submit-token.test.ts runs the real `page.evaluate` callbacks against the sorry fixture in happy-dom and covers a created response field, an existing one, no enclosing form (no submit), and a navigation that never arrives (`navigation_failed`) (dd0d6a0d). Breaking the token fill in browser.ts fails these tests while browser.test.ts stays green."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"threadId": "PRRT_kwDOVL2EQc6zYDcj",
			"commentId": 4461659390,
			"isResolved": true,
			"isOutdated": false,
			"resolvedBy": "joeblackwaslike",
			"replies": [
				{
					"id": 4461883894,
					"author": "joeblackwaslike",
					"createdAt": "2026-11-03T23:54:50Z",
					"editedAt": null,
					"body": "A `status: 1` reply with an empty `request` now fails `isApiReply`, so an empty task id fails the submit as `provider_error` and an empty token is retried like any malformed poll until the deadline (fe94bd6f). Both cases have tests."
				}
			]
		}
	],
